# Carbuncle Debacle (battlefield.carbuncle_debacle_cloister_of_storms, CloisterOfStorms): the requirement arms of the
# registrant (BattlefieldQuest's check: only the registrant needs the quest state and the item). Main, a level 75
# Warrior with the quest accepted and the pendulum but CarbuncleDebacleProgress 2: the trade to LP_Entrance: no options.
# bob, CarbuncleDebacleProgress 3 and the pendulum, the quest only available: no options. cat, accepted and
# CarbuncleDebacleProgress 3 but no pendulum (no trade): no options. dan, the quest completed, CarbuncleDebacleProgress
# 3 and the pendulum: a registrant needs accepted: no options.
lists CloisterOfStorms/LP_Entrance/onTrade CloisterOfStorms/LP_Entrance/onTrigger
char zone=CloisterOfStorms pos=536.6,-14.9,493.0 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=CloisterOfStorms pos=536.6,-14.9,493.0 job=WAR lvl=75
char cat zone=CloisterOfStorms pos=536.6,-14.9,493.0 job=WAR lvl=75
char dan zone=CloisterOfStorms pos=536.6,-14.9,493.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Windurst.CarbuncleDebacle accepted
charvar CarbuncleDebacleProgress 2
item LightningPendulum
bob: charvar CarbuncleDebacleProgress 3
bob: item LightningPendulum
cat: quest Windurst.CarbuncleDebacle accepted
cat: charvar CarbuncleDebacleProgress 3
dan: quest Windurst.CarbuncleDebacle completed
dan: charvar CarbuncleDebacleProgress 3
dan: item LightningPendulum
login
trade LP_Entrance LightningPendulum x1      # CarbuncleDebacleProgress 2: no options
bob: login
bob: trade LP_Entrance LightningPendulum x1 # available: no options
cat: login
cat: trigger LP_Entrance               # no pendulum traded: no options
dan: login
dan: trade LP_Entrance LightningPendulum x1 # completed: no options
